  {
   "id": "a125",
   "kind": "attr:alt",
   "en": "Coach David Ciboch, M.Ed. Sport Science, performing a barbell squat"
  },
  {
   "id": "h126",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span class=\"cb-dot\"></span><span><b>Coach David Ciboch</b><span>M.Ed. Sport Science · National-Team S&amp;C</span></span>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h127",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Who built this"
  },
  {
   "id": "h128",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Coached at the <em>national-team level.</em>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h129",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "FOUNDATIONS isn’t a template from the internet. Every session was built by <strong style=\"color:var(--ink);font-weight:600;\">Coach David Ciboch</strong> — a decade of coaching from youth development to the UAE National Ice Hockey Team, applied to the exact age window your child is in right now."
  },
  {
   "id": "h130",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Master’s Degree (M.Ed.) — PE &amp; Sport Science"
  },
  {
   "id": "h131",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Certified Strength &amp; Conditioning Coach"
  },
  {
   "id": "h132",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Former National Team Coach — UAE Ice Hockey"
  },
  {
   "id": "h133",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "1,000+ athletes developed across 30+ countries"
  },
  {
   "id": "h134",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "02 — What's Inside"
  },
  {
   "id": "h135",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Everything your young player <em>needs.</em>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h136",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "A complete, coach-built season of off-ice training — written for a 9–11-year-old body, not borrowed from an adult plan."
  },
  {
   "id": "h137",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "24 Coach-Built Sessions"
  },
  {
   "id": "h138",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Three sessions a week for eight weeks, each about 35–50 minutes. Every session is laid out step-by-step — just run them in order."
  },
  {
   "id": "h139",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Video for Every Exercise"
  },
  {
   "id": "h140",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "No guessing what a move looks like. Every single exercise links to a clean demo video your child can copy in seconds."
  },
  {
   "id": "h141",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "5 Skill-Check Tests"
  },
  {
   "id": "h142",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Five simple, measurable tests — a real number to beat at Week 1, 4 and 8. Progress you can actually see, not just hope for."
  },
  {
   "id": "h143",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Easier &amp; Harder Scaling"
  },
  {
   "id": "h144",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Every move comes with a simpler version and a harder version — so it fits whether your child is brand-new or already athletic."
  },
  {
   "id": "h145",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "The RAMP Warm-Up"
  },
  {
   "id": "h146",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "A built-in 8–10 minute warm-up before every session — Raise, Activate, Mobilize, Potentiate — that grooves good movement and prevents injury."
  },
  {
   "id": "h147",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Full Glossary &amp; Notes"
  },
  {
   "id": "h148",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Plain-English coaching notes and a complete glossary, so parents can run every session with confidence — no S&amp;C background needed."
  },
  {
   "id": "h149",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "03 — The Plan"
  },
  {
   "id": "h150",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "The 8-week <em>journey.</em>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h151",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Two focused blocks that build in the right order — learn to land softly first, then learn to spring and play fast."
  },
  {
   "id": "h152",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span class=\"jb-label\">Block 1</span><span class=\"jb-weeks\">Weeks 1–4</span>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h153",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Move &amp; Land"
  },
  {
   "id": "h154",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Squat, hinge, balance, skip, and soft \"stuck\" landings, plus low, quiet ankle pogos. No big bounding yet. The work builds Week 1→3, then Week 4 is an easy week with a skills check."
  },
  {
   "id": "h155",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span class=\"jb-label\">Block 2</span><span class=\"jb-weeks\">Weeks 5–8</span>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h156",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Spring &amp; Play"
  },
  {
   "id": "h157",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Low bounds, broad-jump-to-sprint, light ball throws, and reactive games. Builds Week 5→7 to a peak, then Week 8 lightens up for a fun final skills check."
  },
  {
   "id": "h158",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "The work builds for three weeks, then eases off — Week 4 is an easy week with a skills check, and Week 8 lightens up so your child feels fast and fresh to show it all. You always finish strong."
  },
  {
   "id": "h159",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span class=\"ms-wk\">Week 4</span><span class=\"ms-txt\">Easy week + skills check</span>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h160",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span class=\"ms-wk\">Week 8</span><span class=\"ms-txt\">Show it + final skills check</span>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h161",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "04 — A Week"
  },
  {
   "id": "h162",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "The weekly <em>rhythm.</em>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h163",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Three sessions a week, with a rest or free-play day in between. The three days rotate focus so nothing repeats and everything gets covered."
  },
  {
   "id": "h164",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Day 1"
  },
  {
   "id": "h165",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Run &amp; Land"
  },
  {
   "id": "h166",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Acceleration, smooth sprinting mechanics, and soft, balanced landings that protect growing joints."
  },
  {
   "id": "h167",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Day 2"
  },
  {
   "id": "h168",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Bound &amp; Cut"
  },
  {
   "id": "h169",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Springy bounds, lateral push, and change-of-direction — the raw materials of explosive skating."
  },
  {
   "id": "h170",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Day 3"
  },
  {
   "id": "h171",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Move &amp; Play"
  },
  {
   "id": "h172",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Coordination, strength, and reactive games that keep it joyful while building a complete young athlete."
  },
  {
   "id": "h173",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Rest or free-play days sit in between — recovery is where young athletes actually grow."
  },
  {
   "id": "h174",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "05 — Proof"
  },
  {
   "id": "h175",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Progress you can <em>measure.</em>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h176",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Five simple tests — every one gives you a number to beat. Do the same five, in the same order, three times: Week 1, Week 4, and Week 8. No gym needed."
  },
  {
