   "en": "Wk 1"
  },
  {
   "id": "h201",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Wk 8"
  },
  {
   "id": "h202",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Real numbers.<br>Real progress."
  },
  {
   "id": "h203",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Write down the best number, then beat it. That's how kids stay motivated for eight weeks."
  },
  {
   "id": "h204",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "06 — Parents"
  },
  {
   "id": "h205",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Loved by hockey <em>families.</em>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h206",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "From parents who wanted real off-ice training for their kids — without the gym, the guesswork, or the boredom."
  },
  {
   "id": "h207",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "My son actually <em>asks</em> to do his hockey training now. Three weeks in and his coach noticed his skating looked smoother. The videos make it impossible to get wrong."
  },
  {
   "id": "h208",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "S"
  },
  {
   "id": "h209",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Sarah M."
  },
  {
   "id": "h210",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Hockey mom · Ages 9–11"
  },
  {
   "id": "h211",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Finally something built for a 10-year-old, not a watered-down adult workout. The skill tests keep him motivated — he loves beating his own numbers every few weeks."
  },
  {
   "id": "h212",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "D"
  },
  {
   "id": "h213",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Dave K."
  },
  {
   "id": "h214",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Hockey dad"
  },
  {
   "id": "h215",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "No gym, no stress — we do it in the garage and at the park. Worth every penny for how much more confident and coordinated she's gotten on her feet."
  },
  {
   "id": "h216",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "J"
  },
  {
   "id": "h217",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Jenna R."
  },
  {
   "id": "h218",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Hockey mom"
  },
  {
   "id": "h219",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "07 — The Kit"
  },
  {
   "id": "h220",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "No gym. <em>No barrier.</em>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h221",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Wonderfully simple. A band, a couple of light dumbbells, a low box, and a little space — that's the whole list."
  },
  {
   "id": "h222",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Loop resistance bands"
  },
  {
   "id": "h223",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Light dumbbells (or a filled bottle)"
  },
  {
   "id": "h224",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "A low box or step"
  },
  {
   "id": "h225",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Space to move"
  },
  {
   "id": "h226",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "An open stretch for sprints"
  },
  {
   "id": "h227",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Done at home, in a garage, or at the park. No heavy weights, no cost barrier — just room to move and play."
  },
  {
   "id": "h228",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "08 — Two Rules"
  },
  {
   "id": "h229",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Non-<em>negotiable.</em>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h230",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<b>Every landing is soft and \"stuck.\"</b> We teach the body to absorb and balance before we ask it to bounce — this is how we keep young joints safe."
  },
  {
   "id": "h231",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<b>It stays fun.</b> Quality reps, long rest, lots of games. If it ever feels like a grind, make it lighter and more playful — the fun is what builds the athlete."
  },
  {
   "id": "h232",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "09 — Questions"
  },
  {
   "id": "h233",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Good to <em>know.</em>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h234",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span>Is this safe for a 9–11-year-old?</span><span class=\"faq-ico\"></span>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h235",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Yes — that's the whole point. It's built from the ground up for growing bodies, with soft \"stuck\" landings and joint-friendly progressions as non-negotiable rules. As with any program, have your child cleared for physical activity by a physician before starting."
  },
  {
   "id": "h236",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span>Do I need a gym or equipment?</span><span class=\"faq-ico\"></span>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h237",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "No gym. Just a resistance band, a couple of light dumbbells, a low box, and space to move — most of it can be done at home, in a garage, or at the park. The sprint tests just need a longer open stretch like a field."
  },
  {
   "id": "h238",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span>How is the program delivered?</span><span class=\"faq-ico\"></span>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h239",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "It's a clean, interactive web program you open on any phone, tablet, or laptop — with a demo video built into every exercise. No PDF to lose, no app to install. Buy once and it's yours forever."
  },
  {
   "id": "h240",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span>How much time does each session take?</span><span class=\"faq-ico\"></span>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h241",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "About 35–50 minutes, three times a week — closer to 60 on the peak weeks. That includes the built-in RAMP warm-up. Run them in order; the plan does the thinking for you."
  },
  {
   "id": "h242",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span>Will 8 weeks really make a difference?</span><span class=\"faq-ico\"></span>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h243",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Eight weeks won't turn a child into a powerhouse — and shouldn't. What it builds is better: softer landings, steadier balance, smoother sprinting, and a love of moving well. The five skill-check tests will show you the progress in real numbers."
  },
  {
   "id": "h244",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span>Is it too late to start before the season?</span><span class=\"faq-ico\"></span>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h245",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "No — and waiting for a &quot;perfect&quot; start date is the real mistake. If a full 8 weeks fits before your season, your athlete arrives at day one at their peak. If the season starts sooner, the first weeks of movement, balance, and speed work still show up on the ice within a month — and the program runs fine alongside early-season practices (drop to two sessions in heavy game weeks). Every week you wait is a week of the season played without it."
  },
  {
   "id": "h246",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<span>What if it's not the right fit?</span><span class=\"faq-ico\"></span>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h247",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "You're covered by a 30-day money-back guarantee. Try it, run the first sessions, and if it isn't right for your young player, just email us and we'll refund you — no hassle."
  },
  {
   "id": "h248",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "<b>Prefer a subscription with a free trial?</b> The Elite Hockey Drills app runs your whole season, personalized to you. First week free on iOS and Android."
  },
