   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Founding Launch Price · Limited"
  },
  {
   "id": "h252",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Give them the <em>head start.</em>"
  },
  {
   "id": "h253",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "Eight weeks that build the speed, balance, and confidence great skating is made of — while keeping it fun."
  },
  {
   "id": "h254",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "One-time · yours forever"
  },
  {
   "id": "h255",
   "kind": "html",
   "en": "24 coached sessions — <b>about $3.30 each</b>. A single private S&amp;C session costs more than the whole program."
